  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Niyas A vs Kerala State Electricity Board on 6 December, 2024 Author: P Gopinath Bench: P Gopinath 2024:Ker:92151 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Gopinath P. Friday, The 6Th Day Of December 2024 / 15Th Agrahayana, 1946 Wp(C) No. 43430 Of 2024 Petitioner: Niyas A., Aged 42 Years, Son Of P. H. Abdul Kasim, Nelluparayil House, Proprietor, Quality Foods, Near Sumangali Travels, Chiyyaram P.O., Chiyyaram Village, Thrissur District, Pin - 680 026. By Advs. Jose Tom C. Kandathil Joy Sebastian Respondents: 1 Kerala State Electricity Board, Represented By Its Managing Director, Vydyuthi Bhavanam, Pattom, Thiruvananthapuram, Pin - 695 004. 2 The Assistant Executive Engineer Kerala State Electricity Board Office Of The Assistant Executive Engineer, Palace Road, Chembukkav, Thrissur, Pin - 680 020. 3 The Senior Superintend, Electrical Section, Kseb, Koorkenchery Post, Kanimangalam, Thrissur, Pin - 680 027. 4 Corporation Of Thrissur, Represented By Its Secretary, Office Of The Municipal Corporation, Thrissur, Pin - 682 001. 5 The Assistant Executive Engineer, Thrissur Municipal Corporation, Thrissur, Niyas A vs Kerala State Electricity Board on 6 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/81664367/ 1 Pin - 682 001. 2024:Ker:92151 Wp(C) 43430/2024 2 6 K. K. Aravinthakshan, Aged 68 Years, Son Of Krishnamurthy, Kattuthindi House, Chiyyaram Post, Chiyyaram Village, Thrissur Taluk, Thrissur District, Pin - 680 026. By Advs. Santhosh P.Poduval (Sc). Riji Rajendran, Sc, Kseb. This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 06.12.2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: 2024:Ker:92151 Wp(C) 43430/2024 3 Judgment",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The petitioner has approached this Court being aggrieved by the fact that the electricity connection to a building in which he is a tenant has been disconnected on account of the fact that the owner of the building has not paid the Additional Security Deposit of Rs.16,641/-, which has to be paid on or before 08-06-2024. 2. The learned Standing Counsel appearing for the Kerala State Electricity Board would submit that the amount of Additional Security Deposit was payable on 08-06-2024, and since it was not paid, the electricity connection was disconnected on 06-11-2024."
  },
